Subject: [PATCH 04/19] Record why the PNT submission cannot be automated

The platform's production bundle declares showCaptcha with a Cloudflare
Turnstile site key, and the submission path is an Angular SPA against the
SISAI REST API behind an authenticated session. A Turnstile token only comes
from a real browser driven by a person, so presenting the request is a human
step regardless of authorization; everything around it stays automatable.

